{"de1.P1.C3": {"ly_do": "Đã giải độc lập: $\\left(A+B\\right)^{2}=A^{2}+2AB+B^{2}$ (A). Đúng.", "sua_boi": "muse", "xac_nhan": true}, "de1.P4.C1": {"ly_do": "Ý a: $\\left(4a^{2}b-5ab^{3}\\right)+\\left(ab^{3}+3a^{2}b\\right)=7a^{2}b-4ab^{3}$ vì $-5ab^{3}+ab^{3}=-4ab^{3}$; đáp án B đúng nên chỉ sửa lời giải. Các ý khác đã kiểm đúng: b $25x^{3}-24x^{2}+6$, c $7x^{3}y+5x-3$.", "parts": [{"correctAnswer": 1, "explanation": "$\\text{(4}{{\\text{a}}^{\\text{2}}}\\text{b + 3}{{\\text{a}}^{\\text{2}}}\\text{b) + ( -5a}{{\\text{b}}^{\\text{3}}}\\text{ + a}{{\\text{b}}^{\\text{3}}}\\text{)}$\n$= 7{{\\text{a}}^{\\text{2}}}\\text{b - 4a}{{\\text{b}}^{\\text{3}}}$", "id": "a", "label": "a", "options": ["$7a^2b+2ab^3$", "$7a^2b-4ab^3$", "$7a^2b-2ab^3$", "$7a^2b-6ab^3$"], "points": 1, "question": "$\\text{(4}{{\\text{a}}^{\\text{2}}}\\text{b - 5a}{{\\text{b}}^{\\text{3}}}\\text{) + (a}{{\\text{b}}^{\\text{3}}}\\text{ + 3}{{\\text{a}}^{\\text{2}}}\\text{b)}$", "type": "multiple_choice"}, {"correctAnswer": 1, "explanation": "$\\text{6}{{\\text{x}}^{\\text{2}}}\\text{.3 - 6}{{\\text{x}}^{\\text{2}}}\\text{.4 + 7}{{\\text{x}}^{\\text{3}}}\\text{ + 6}$\n$=18{{\\text{x}}^{\\text{3}}}\\text{ - 24}{{\\text{x}}^{\\text{2}}}\\text{ + 7}{{\\text{x}}^{\\text{3}}}\\text{ + 6}$\n$=25{{\\text{x}}^{\\text{3}}}\\text{ - 24}{{\\text{x}}^{\\text{2}}}\\text{ + 6}$", "id": "b", "label": "b", "options": ["$25x^3-24x^2$", "$25x^3-24x^2+6$", "$13x^3-24x^2+6$", "$25x^3+24x^2+6$"], "points": 1, "question": "$\\text{6}{{\\text{x}}^{\\text{2}}}\\text{.(3x - 4) + 7}{{\\text{x}}^{\\text{3}}}\\text{ + 6}$", "type": "multiple_choice"}, {"correctAnswer": 3, "explanation": "$\\text{( 14}{{\\text{x}}^{\\text{5}}}{{\\text{y}}^{\\text{2}}}\\text{ : 2}{{\\text{x}}^{\\text{2}}}\\text{y) - ( 6}{{\\text{x}}^{\\text{2}}}\\text{y : 2}{{\\text{x}}^{\\text{2}}}\\text{y) + ( 10}{{\\text{x}}^{\\text{3}}}\\text{y : 2}{{\\text{x}}^{\\text{2}}}\\text{y)}$\n$=7{{\\text{x}}^{\\text{3}}}\\text{y + 5x - 3}$", "id": "c", "label": "c", "options": ["$7x^3y-5x-3$", "$7x^3y+5x+3$", "$7x^3y+5x$", "$7x^3y+5x-3$"], "points": 1, "question": "$\\text{(14}{{\\text{x}}^{\\text{5}}}{{\\text{y}}^{\\text{2}}}\\text{ - 6}{{\\text{x}}^{\\text{2}}}\\text{y + 10}{{\\text{x}}^{\\text{3}}}\\text{y) : (2}{{\\text{x}}^{\\text{2}}}\\text{y)}$", "type": "multiple_choice"}], "sua_boi": "muse"}}